* Auto-generated testbench for RC filter: R701/C701
* Type: low-pass, expected fc = 159.2 Hz
* Model: ideal passives (exact for RC)


R701 _3V3 CODEC_RST 10k

C701 CODEC_RST 0 100n

* AC stimulus
VAC _3V3 0 DC 0 AC 1

.control
ac dec 100 1.592 15.91k
meas ac fc_sim when vdb(CODEC_RST)=-3
meas ac phase_fc find vp(CODEC_RST) at=fc_sim
echo "fc_sim=$&fc_sim phase_fc=$&phase_fc has_parasitics=0" > docs/references/hat-revb-cost-20261104/spice-work/rc-filter_R701_C701.out
quit
.endc

.end
